<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore Reinsurance shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Singapore Reinsurance shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Reinsurance Corp Ltd said on Wednesday it asked the Stock Exchange of Singapore to suspend trading of its shares on Thursday, March 27.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the request was related to the pending release of its audited financial results for 1996 which were due to be published on March 28.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
